### 1. Register User
# @name register
POST {{host}}/api/v1/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 2. Login User
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/v1/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Read JWT token dynamically from login response:
@authToken = {{login.response.body.token}}

### Create a Case
# @name createCase
POST {{host}}/api/v1/cases
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Title": "{{case1}}",
  "Description": "family annihilator"
}

### get case uuid
@caseId = {{createCase.response.body.id}}

### Create Milestone (also attaches it to a case)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/cases/{{caseId}}/milestones
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Disappearance Reported",
  "description": "Shanann Watts reported missing by her friend Nickole Atkinson after missed doctor appointments.",
  "date_precision": "day"
  "event_date": "2018-08-13T12:00:00Z"
}











### 3. Create a Video (Seed DB)
# @name createVideo
POST {{host}}/api/v1/videos
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ"
}

### Read video ID dynamically from createVideo response:
@videoId = {{createVideo.response.body.id}}

### 4. Enrich Video
# @name enrichVideo
POST {{host}}/api/v1/videos/{{videoId}}/enrich
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Title": "the chris watts case",
  "Description": "family annihilator"
}

### 5. Create a Case


### Read case ID dynamically from createCase response:


### 6. Attach Milestone to Case
# @name createMilestone
POST {{host}}/api/v1/cases/{{caseId}}/milestones
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Disappearance Reported",
  "description": "Shanann Watts reported missing by her friend Nickole Atkinson after missed doctor appointments.",
  "event_date": "2018-08-13T12:00:00Z"
}

### Read milestone ID dynamically from createMilestone response:
@milestoneId = {{createMilestone.response.body.id}}

### 7. List Unlinked Videos
GET {{host}}/api/v1/videos/unlinked
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 8. List Linked Videos
GET {{host}}/api/v1/videos/linked
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 9. Get Cases
GET {{host}}/api/v1/cases
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 10. Get Milestones for Case
GET {{host}}/api/v1/cases/{{caseId}}/milestones
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 11. Attach Video to Milestone
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/milestones/{{milestoneId}}/videos/{{videoId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "youtube_video_id": "dQw4w9WgXcQ",
  "title": "Police Bodycam: Initial Welfare Check",
  "channel_name": "True Crime Recaps",
  "status": "analyzed",
  "summary": "Officer arrival at the residence, initial walkthrough with Chris Watts, and early neighborhood canvassing.",
  "category": "Bodycam"
}

### 12. Get Videos by Milestone
GET {{host}}/api/v1/milestones/{{milestoneId}}/videos
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 13. Record Video Watch
POST {{host}}/api/v1/watch
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "video_id": "{{videoId}}",
  "completed": true
}

### 14. Get Watch History
GET {{host}}/api/v1/watch/history
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}